cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DATA AUTOPSY: a statistical and data-quality investigation tool for CSV datasets"
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: amsx1
    name: amsx1
repository-code: "https://github.com/amsx1/data-science-lab"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  DATA AUTOPSY performs an automated, deterministic investigation of a CSV dataset:
  structure and data-type profiling, missing-value and duplicate analysis,
  constant/low-variance feature detection, descriptive statistics, outlier detection
  (IQR, z-score, modified z-score), correlation and categorical association analysis,
  Isolation Forest anomaly detection, heuristic potential-leakage screening, and a
  transparent weighted dataset health score with an exportable report.
keywords:
  - data quality
  - exploratory data analysis
  - anomaly detection
  - data leakage
  - statistics
  - python
